msgstr "请先在 Clash Verge 导入并选中你的订阅，再回来复制节点。"

msgid "Select a profile in Clash Verge first."
msgstr "请先在 Clash Verge 选中一个配置。"

msgid "The active profile file is missing."
msgstr "找不到当前配置文件。"

msgid "--text=Copy nodes from your current Clash Verge profile into Cage? This makes a local snapshot. Import it again after subscription updates."
msgstr "--text=将 Clash Verge 当前配置中的节点复制到本机 Cage？这是本地快照，订阅更新后可在 Cage 中重新导入。"

