msgstr "节点尚未启动，请查看 Cage 工作台的代理状态。"

msgid "--text=Node applied and proxy started. Return to the Cage workbench to install the guest."
msgstr "--text=节点已应用，代理已启动。请回到 Cage 工作台继续安装客机。"

msgid "Cannot read the local profile. Check the workbench."
msgstr "无法读取本地配置，请检查工作台状态。"

msgid "--text=Cannot read the profile or contact Cage. Open the workbench and sign in first."
msgstr "--text=无法读取配置或联系 Cage。请先打开工作台，完成登录后再试。"

